<title>FINLAND: SILJA AUG PASSENGERS ROSE 14 PCT.</title>
<headline>SILJA AUG PASSENGERS ROSE 14 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish passenger ferry operator</p>
<p>Silja Oy said in a statement on Thursday its passenger volume</p>
<p>rose 14 percent year-on-year to 630,380 in August.</p>
<p>In traffic between Finland and Sweden growth was two percent</p>
<p>but the route Helsinki-Tallinn doubled its passengers. In August</p>
<p>1995, the Tallinn route operated only half a month, Silja said.</p>
</text>
